idea-plugin.description:
Shows newer stable Maven dependency and build-plugin versions in pom.xml, npm, pnpm, Yarn and Bun dependency versions in package.json and Gradle library versions in build scripts and local catalogs
through IntelliJ IDEA's standard inspections. Maven checks use IDEA's Maven configuration;
Node package checks use the configured local runtime and matching manager’s registry configuration;
Gradle checks use its linked project tooling, wrapper/JVM and Gradle repositories.
Includes version update quick fixes and bulk previews for patch, minor or major versions
in the current build file or across the project. Node package updates edit manifests only;
use the matching manager to synchronize lockfiles and installed dependencies afterward.
Gradle updates edit declarations only; reload the project and synchronize dependency locks afterward.
